<title>UK: DSL Bank to launch $500 mln five-year bond soon.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank to launch $500 mln five-year bond soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSL Bank Deutsche Siedlungs-und Landesrentenbank will issue a $500 million five-year bond in the near future, joint lead Nomura said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced to yield 11 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch is the other joint lead manager.  </p>
<p>The deal will not be increased, Nomura said.</p>
<p>DSL Bank last tapped the Eurobond market on January 16 with a $300 million four-year bond which was priced to yield 12 b.p. over Treasuries.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
